   "headlines": [
    {
     "type": "Recap",
     "description": "— Sam Leavitt threw for 289 yards and four touchdowns in what also was his first turnover-free game this season, and No. 22 LSU raced to a three-touchdown, first-half lead on its way to a 31-0 victory over injury-depleted, 16th-ranked Mississippi...",
